  "memory": "Immutable coefficient buffers shared by scoped identity checks; no pixels, source JPEG, copied frame-wide DC/AC planes or frame-wide token arrays in the adapter/writer. Two predictor rows and one 64-value scratch block. Conservative admission includes six output bounds and 4 MiB fixed scratch/tables. Caller must additionally admit JPEG source, decoded events and reconstruction metadata. Not peak-RSS evidence.",
